P("The synthetic benchmark picks {{sel.syn.pick}} at every texture amplitude, with a mean loss of {{sel.syn}}. This pick depends on the training seed. With the seed-{{d.seed0}} models the benchmark picks {{sel.s0.pick}} (mean loss {{sel.s0.loss}}), an architecture whose synthetic Dice is {{eff.s0}}, {{eff.s1}} and {{eff.s2}} at seeds {{d.seeds}}; with the seed-{{d.seed1}} models the pick is {{sel.s1.pick}} again, but its mean loss is {{sel.s1.loss}} because the best models change (Online Resource 1, Table S7b).", { after: 100 });
